SUMMARY:ENS-Data Science colloquium – Marc Lelarge (INRIA & DIENS) : Math
 ematics as an experimental science
DESCRIPTION:| AI is transforming the field of mathematics. In this talk\, I
  will present some on-going experiments that we are conducting with Large 
 Language Models\, proof assistants and an unusual large number of colleagu
 es. We build new tools to find and check proofs and experiment them in the
  areas of graph theory and high dimensional probability. These experiments
  would not have been possible a few…\nhttps://www.math.ens.psl.eu/evenem
 ent/ens-data-science-colloquium-mathematics-as-an-experimental-science/
LOCATION:Amphi Jean Jaurès\, 29 rue d'Ulm\, 75005\, PARIS
URL:https://www.math.ens.psl.eu/evenement/ens-data-science-colloquium-mathe
 matics-as-an-experimental-science/
END:VEVENT
